#HELPS

-1 'NEWBIE INFO' START BEGIN BEGINNER 'GETTING STARTED'~
Welcome!  New characters start at the Entrance to Mud School.  Walk
through it first: the signs and room descriptions teach the basics, and
the diploma at the end is worth wearing.  Don't try to kill the blob.

Useful first commands:

  score       your character          equipment   what you wear
  skills      your skills             spells      your spells
  commands    every command           help <word> help on anything

HELP BEGINNERS is a short guide to moving, learning, dying and the
settings.  HELP NEW lists the settings you can change.

See also: BEGINNERS, NEW, RULES, MUDSCHOOL
~


-1 BEGINNERS~
A short guide for your first hours.  HELP <word> explains any command;
HELP KEYWORDS lists every topic.

Moving
  N, S, E, W, U, D (and NE, NW, SE, SW) move you; LOOK looks around.
  WALKTO <place> walks you to an area, trainer or guild hall, and
  RECALL takes you to the Temple when you are lost.

Your character
  SCORE, INVENTORY, EQUIPMENT, AFFECTS and SKILLS show where you stand.
  Hit points are your life, mana powers spells, and endurance pays for
  moving.  At zero hit points you are helpless; much below it you die.

Learning
  PRACTICE improves skills you know, GAIN buys new ones with trains, and
  TRAIN raises your stats.  GAINLIST shows what you can buy, and where.
  Join a guild with Melancholy (WALKTO MELANCHOLY) from level 3 to 6.

Staying alive
  CONSIDER a monster before you fight it, and set WIMPY so you flee when
  badly hurt.  If you die your gear waits in your corpse: see DEATH.

Talking
  GOSSIP <message> reaches everybody; TELL <name> <message> one player.

Settings and clients
  HELP NEW lists your settings: colour, prompt, damage numbers, autoloot.
  The Mudlet package and the browser client add maps and gauges.

In Dresden, the BANK keeps coin safe and pays 0.25% a day on balances of
a platinum or more.  CHANGES lists what is new.

See also: NORTH, WALKTO, PRACTICE, GUILDS, DEATH, NEW, MUDLET, WEB
~

